.SH "NAME"
Docv::Macros::Man \- The man(7) macro package (groff an.tmac and an\-ext.tmac), implemented natively on the roff engine.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Macros::Man < Docv::Roff::Package\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The man(7) macro package (groff an.tmac and an\-ext.tmac), implemented
natively on the roff engine.
.SH "INHERITANCE"
Docv::Macros::Man < Docv::Roff::Package < Reference < Object
